  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e444148c9f4c423c",
      "translationZh": "Simon Willison 的网络日志",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "253c96c5e4cdd624",
      "translationZh": "2026年8月29日 - 链接博客",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f73441f36a2b50dd",
      "translationZh": "介绍 Hy4 Preview。中国公司 Tencent 今天推出了一款新的开放权重、仅接受文本输入（不支持视觉）的 LLM：总参数量为 770B，激活参数量为 49B，上下文窗口为 1M token，在 Hugging Face 上的大小为 1.56TB。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b058d20b202eae89",
      "translationZh": "与他们在7月推出的上一款 Hy3 相比，这次规模大幅增加；Hy3 的总参数量为 295B，激活参数量为 21B，上下文长度为 256,000，大小为 598GB。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d67acff4931b149",
      "translationZh": "我最近开始通过模型的聊天模板来更好地了解它们的能力。这是 Hugging Face 上 Hy4 的 chat_template.jinja，其中包含以下部分：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77eb79fa59af976c",
      "translationZh": "所以看起来推理强度只有两个级别：\"high\"（默认）和 \"no_think\"（禁用推理）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b5d8afa118a345e",
      "translationZh": "我通过 OpenRouter，以默认的高推理强度试用了我的“生成一张鹈鹕骑自行车的 SVG”提示词，得到了这个结果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90fff04bb5140b8b",
      "translationZh": "引用其推理轨迹：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "117b774b0bce00e2",
      "translationZh": "[...] 要不加个头盔？这样可以强化骑行主题，但可能会遮住头部。也许加一顶小骑行帽或一个头盔？用户没要求；可以加个红色头盔？可能挺可爱的。不过鹈鹕的喙很大；头盔可能会挡住。也许还是不加更好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16f587ec90cfa5dd",
      "translationZh": "要不加副太阳镜？算了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c25a11db09775a1",
      "translationZh": "有意思的是，这段推理轨迹使用了略有省略的英语，大概是因为对于隐藏的推理文本来说，完美的语法既没什么用，也不节省 token。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46ba3d16f884c3ed",
      "translationZh": "发布于 2026 年 8 月 29 日晚上 11:53",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
