      "sourceHash": "20c7d85fce8bbfad",
      "translationZh": "这是一篇由 Simon Willison 发布的链接帖，发布于 2026 年 8 月 29 日。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aebea5114996d500",
      "translationZh": "每月赞助我 10，即可收到一份精选邮件摘要，汇总当月最重要的 LLM 进展。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d7e2af1af334b34",
      "translationZh": "付钱给我，让我少给你发点内容！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
